From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:06:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCodec: keep the Dolby Vision output for the next decoder

A decoder close ends the Dolby Vision source, and the core follows it
to bypass until the next decoder starts it again. Between two Dolby
Vision items the sink sees Dolby Vision, SDR, then Dolby Vision, and
can drop the picture for seconds.
---
