 .../VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/AMLCodec.h    |  30 +++
 .../DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecAmlogic.cpp  |   1 +
 xbmc/utils/AMLUtils.cpp                       |  11 ++
 xbmc/utils/AMLUtils.h                         |   2 +
 5 files changed, 219 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

